From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 10:46:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/vaddr: handle midd of folio stat

The issue was discovered [1] by Sashiko.

[1] https://lore.kernel.org/20260514015053.149396-1-sj@kernel.org

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/vaddr.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/vaddr.c b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
index aacba55fd6ea8..503e969af2e48 100644
--- a/mm/damon/vaddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/vaddr.c
@@ -824,6 +824,8 @@ static int damos_va_stat_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 		return 0;
 
 	for (; addr < next; pte += nr, addr += nr * PAGE_SIZE) {
+		unsigned long page_idx;
+
 		nr = 1;
 		ptent = ptep_get(pte);
 
@@ -837,7 +839,8 @@ static int damos_va_stat_pmd_entry(pmd_t *pmd, unsigned long addr,
 
 		if (!damos_va_filter_out(s, folio, vma, addr, pte, NULL))
 			*sz_filter_passed += folio_size(folio);
-		nr = folio_nr_pages(folio);
+		page_idx = folio_page_idx(folio, pte_page(*pte));
+		nr = folio_nr_pages(folio) - page_idx;
 		s->last_applied = folio;
 	}
 	pte_unmap_unlock(start_pte, ptl);
-- 
2.47.3

